  "content": "[Intro]\nOh, the\n\n[Verse 1]\n[C#]weather outside is\nfrightful But the\n[Db/F]fire is [C#dim/E]so de-\n[G#/D#]lightful And\n[D#m7]since we've no [Ddim/Ab]place to\n[D#m7]go Let it snow,\n[D#m7]let it snow, [Fm/Ab]let it snow\n[C#]Man it\n[C#]doesn't show signs of\nstoppin' And I\n[Db/F]brought me some [C#dim/E]corn for\n[G#/D#]poppin' The\n[D#m7]lights are turned [Ddim/Ab]way down\n[D#m7]low Let it snow,\n[D#m7][Fm/Ab]let it\n[C#]snow. When we\n\n[Chorus]\n[Fm/Ab]finally [Fm/D#]kiss goodnight\n[Fm/Ab][F/A]How I'll\n[A#m7]hate going [D#]out in the\n[Fm/Ab]storm But if\n[Fm/Ab]you really [G#/D#]hold me\n[Cm7]tight [F]\n[A#7]All the way home [D#]I'll be warm\n[G#7]And the\n\n[Verse 2]\n[C#]fire is slowly\ndying And, my\n[Db/F]dear, we're [C#dim/E]still good-\n[G#/D#]byeing But as\n[D#m7]long as you [Ddim/Ab]love me\n[D#m7]so Let it snow,\n[D#m7]let it snow, [Fm/Ab]and snow\n[C#]\n\n[Bridge]\n[C#]\n[Db/F]  [C#dim/E]\n[G#/D#]\n[D#m7]  [Ddim/Ab]\n[D#m7]\n[D#m7]  [Fm/Ab]\n[C#]When we\n\n[Chorus]\n[Fm/Ab]finally [Fm/D#]kiss goodnight\n[Fm/Ab][F/A]How I'll\n[A#m7]hate going [D#]out in the\n[Fm/Ab]storm But if\n[Fm/Ab]you really [G#/D#]grab me\n[Cm7]tight [F]\n[A#7]All the way home [D#]I'll be warm\n[G#7][A7]Oh the\n\n[Verse 3]\n[D]fire is slowly\ndying And, my\n[D/F#]dear, we're [Fdim]still good-\n[A/E]byeing But as\n[Em7]long as you [D#dim/A]love me\n[Em7]so Let it snow,\n[A7]let it snow,\nlet it\n\n[Outro]\n[D]snow\n[Em7]  [A/E]\n[D]",
